    "text": "If $\\left[\\begin{array}{ll}2 & 1 \\\\ 3 & 2\\end{array}\\right] \\cdot A \\cdot\\left[\\begin{array}{cc}-3 & 2 \\\\ 5 & -3\\end{array}\\right]=\\left[\\begin{array}{ll}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{array}\\right]$, then $A=$"
